    "why": "One fact -- the client Oriole Systems -- written sixteen ways. The PRD states the gate's coverage bound in prose ('a client name in prose, a heading, JSON, shell, Python or most config syntax produces no finding'). Prose degrades silently: it stays on the page while the classifier changes underneath it. This turns the bound into a number that moves when the classifier does.",
